{"id":"ba4592cee3b1b3f0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-knot-peripheral-data.md","title":"Knot Tubular and Peripheral Data","display":"df-knot-peripheral-data — Knot Tubular and Peripheral Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-knot-peripheral-data","aliases":["58-df-knot-peripheral-data"],"display":"df-knot-peripheral-data — Knot Tubular and Peripheral Data","depends_on":["[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]","[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-knot-peripheral-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-knot-peripheral-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-knot-peripheral-data — Knot Tubular and Peripheral Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,N,T,e,h,\\phi,\\mu,\\lambda,a\\in V\">\\(K,N,T,e,h,\\phi,\\mu,\\lambda,a\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^r\">\\(S^r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^r=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(r)\">\\(D^r=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathring D^r=\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(r)\">\\(\\mathring D^r=\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(r)\\)</span> 使用以有限序数为定义域的实向量编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1}\\rangle_r=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\">\\(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1}\\rangle_r=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\\)</span>；不带维数下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 是用于集合积的有序对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|x\\|=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}x}x(i)^2}\">\\(\\|x\\|=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in\\operatorname{dom}x}x(i)^2}\\)</span>，向量加法和实数乘法逐坐标计算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^r,r+1)\">\\(\\tau_{S^r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^r,r+1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{D^r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D^r,r)\">\\(\\tau_{D^r}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D^r,r)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_0=S^1\\times D^2\">\\(V_0=S^1\\times D^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_0^\\circ=S^1\\times\\mathring D^2\">\\(V_0^\\circ=S^1\\times\\mathring D^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0=S^1\\times S^1\">\\(T_0=S^1\\times S^1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{V_0}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(S^1,\\tau_{S^1},D^2,\\tau_{D^2})\">\\(\\tau_{V_0}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(S^1,\\tau_{S^1},D^2,\\tau_{D^2})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T_0}=\\{U\\cap T_0:U\\in\\tau_{V_0}\\}\">\\(\\tau_{T_0}=\\{U\\cap T_0:U\\in\\tau_{V_0}\\}\\)</span>。对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq S^3\">\\(A\\subseteq S^3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_{S^3}\\}\">\\(\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_{S^3}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}_3(A)=\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau_{S^3}:U\\subseteq A\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{int}_3(A)=\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau_{S^3}:U\\subseteq A\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_3A=A\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_3(A)\">\\(\\partial_3A=A\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_3(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_A=S^3\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_3(A)\">\\(W_A=S^3\\setminus\\operatorname{int}_3(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_j(A,\\tau)=\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(A,\\tau,j)\">\\(H_j(A,\\tau)=\\mathrm{IntegralSingularHomology}_S(A,\\tau,j)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{A,\\tau,j}=[\\mathbf0_{S_j(A,\\tau)}]^{\\mathrm h}_{A,\\tau,j}\">\\(0_{A,\\tau,j}=[\\mathbf0_{S_j(A,\\tau)}]^{\\mathrm h}_{A,\\tau,j}\\)</span>。对于连续映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(A,\\tau)\\to(B,\\upsilon)\">\\(f:(A,\\tau)\\to(B,\\upsilon)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{*,j}^{(A,\\tau),(B,\\upsilon)}=\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(f,A,\\tau,B,\\upsilon,j)\">\\(f_{*,j}^{(A,\\tau),(B,\\upsilon)}=\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(f,A,\\tau,B,\\upsilon,j)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_A=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in A\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_A=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in A\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RadialDirection}_S(h,x,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{RadialDirection}_S(h,x,r)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为两个欧氏三维开集之间的同胚、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;0\">\\(r&gt;0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{y:\\|y-x\\|\\leq r\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}h\">\\(\\{y:\\|y-x\\|\\leq r\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}h\\)</span> 时使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_3,\\mathcal A_V\">\\(\\mathcal A_3,\\mathcal A_V\\)</span> 是由公式指定的定向图册；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_V\">\\(\\mathcal A_V\\)</span> 只覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_0^\\circ\">\\(V_0^\\circ\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_+=\\langle0,0,0,1\\rangle_4\">\\(N_+=\\langle0,0,0,1\\rangle_4\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_-=\\langle0,0,0,-1\\rangle_4\">\\(N_-=\\langle0,0,0,-1\\rangle_4\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_m,\\ell_l:[0,1]\\to T_0\">\\(\\ell_m,\\ell_l:[0,1]\\to T_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_+,\\phi_-,\\psi_{a,b}\">\\(\\phi_+,\\phi_-,\\psi_{a,b}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{a,b}\">\\(U_{a,b}\\)</span> 均由断言中的函数图定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeridianImage}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeridianImage}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}\">\\(\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}\">\\(\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThreeDimensionalOrientationPreserving}\">\\(\\mathrm{ThreeDimensionalOrientationPreserving}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}\">\\(\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RadialDirection}_S(h,x,r)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle z,\\frac{h(x+rz)-h(x)}{\\|h(x+rz)-h(x)\\|}\\right\\rangle:z\\in S^2\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RadialDirection}_S(h,x,r)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle z,\\frac{h(x+rz)-h(x)}{\\|h(x+rz)-h(x)\\|}\\right\\rangle:z\\in S^2\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ThreeDimensionalOrientationPreserving}_S(h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists U,W\\in\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^3,3)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,U,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(U,3),W,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(W,3))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\|y-x\\|\\leq r\\}\\subseteq U\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(\\mathrm{RadialDirection}_S(h,x,r),S^2,\\tau_{S^2},S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2)\n=\\operatorname{id}_{H_2(S^2,\\tau_{S^2})}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ThreeDimensionalOrientationPreserving}_S(h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists U,W\\in\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^3,3)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,U,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(U,3),W,\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(W,3))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\|y-x\\|\\leq r\\}\\subseteq U\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{SingularHomologyPushforward}_S(\\mathrm{RadialDirection}_S(h,x,r),S^2,\\tau_{S^2},S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2)\n=\\operatorname{id}_{H_2(S^2,\\tau_{S^2})}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\phi_+\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle x,\\left\\langle\\frac{x(0)}{1-x(3)},\\frac{x(1)}{1-x(3)},\\frac{x(2)}{1-x(3)}\\right\\rangle_3\\right\\rangle:x\\in S^3\\setminus\\{N_+\\}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\phi_-\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle x,\\left\\langle\\frac{-x(0)}{1+x(3)},\\frac{x(1)}{1+x(3)},\\frac{x(2)}{1+x(3)}\\right\\rangle_3\\right\\rangle:x\\in S^3\\setminus\\{N_-\\}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_3\\coloneqq\\{\\langle S^3\\setminus\\{N_+\\},\\phi_+\\rangle,\n\\langle S^3\\setminus\\{N_-\\},\\phi_-\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\phi_+\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle x,\\left\\langle\\frac{x(0)}{1-x(3)},\\frac{x(1)}{1-x(3)},\\frac{x(2)}{1-x(3)}\\right\\rangle_3\\right\\rangle:x\\in S^3\\setminus\\{N_+\\}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\phi_-\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle x,\\left\\langle\\frac{-x(0)}{1+x(3)},\\frac{x(1)}{1+x(3)},\\frac{x(2)}{1+x(3)}\\right\\rangle_3\\right\\rangle:x\\in S^3\\setminus\\{N_-\\}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_3\\coloneqq\\{\\langle S^3\\setminus\\{N_+\\},\\phi_+\\rangle,\n\\langle S^3\\setminus\\{N_-\\},\\phi_-\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;b-a&lt;2\\pi\\to\nU_{a,b}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta\\rangle_2,v\\rangle:\\theta\\in(a,b)\\land v\\in\\mathring D^2\\},\\\\\na,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;b-a&lt;2\\pi\\to\n\\psi_{a,b}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta\\rangle_2,v\\rangle,\n\\langle\\theta,v(0),v(1)\\rangle_3\\rangle:\\theta\\in(a,b)\\land v\\in\\mathring D^2\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_V\\coloneqq\\{\\langle U_{a,b},\\psi_{a,b}\\rangle:a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;b-a&lt;2\\pi\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;b-a&lt;2\\pi\\to\nU_{a,b}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta\\rangle_2,v\\rangle:\\theta\\in(a,b)\\land v\\in\\mathring D^2\\},\\\\\na,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;b-a&lt;2\\pi\\to\n\\psi_{a,b}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta\\rangle_2,v\\rangle,\n\\langle\\theta,v(0),v(1)\\rangle_3\\rangle:\\theta\\in(a,b)\\land v\\in\\mathring D^2\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_V\\coloneqq\\{\\langle U_{a,b},\\psi_{a,b}\\rangle:a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;b-a&lt;2\\pi\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}_S(e,N,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nK\\subseteq N\\subseteq S^3\\land\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(e,V_0,\\tau_{V_0},N,\\tau_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e[S^1\\times\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle_2\\}]=K\n\\land e[V_0^\\circ]=\\operatorname{int}_3(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_V\\;\n\\forall\\langle W,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_3\\;\n\\mathrm{ThreeDimensionalOrientationPreserving}_S\n\\left(\\beta\\circ(e\\upharpoonright(U\\cap e^{-1}[W]))\\circ\n(\\alpha\\upharpoonright(U\\cap e^{-1}[W]))^{-1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}_S(e,N,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nK\\subseteq N\\subseteq S^3\\land\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(e,V_0,\\tau_{V_0},N,\\tau_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e[S^1\\times\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle_2\\}]=K\n\\land e[V_0^\\circ]=\\operatorname{int}_3(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_V\\;\n\\forall\\langle W,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_3\\;\n\\mathrm{ThreeDimensionalOrientationPreserving}_S\n\\left(\\beta\\circ(e\\upharpoonright(U\\cap e^{-1}[W]))\\circ\n(\\alpha\\upharpoonright(U\\cap e^{-1}[W]))^{-1}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}_S(N,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}_S(e,N,K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TubularNeighborhood}_S(N,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}_S(e,N,K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_m\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle_2,\\langle\\cos(2\\pi t),\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle_2\\rangle\\rangle:t\\in[0,1]\\},\\\\\n\\ell_l\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,\\langle\\langle\\cos(2\\pi t),\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle_2,\\langle1,0\\rangle_2\\rangle\\rangle:t\\in[0,1]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_m\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle_2,\\langle\\cos(2\\pi t),\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle_2\\rangle\\rangle:t\\in[0,1]\\},\\\\\n\\ell_l\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,\\langle\\langle\\cos(2\\pi t),\\sin(2\\pi t)\\rangle_2,\\langle1,0\\rangle_2\\rangle\\rangle:t\\in[0,1]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}_S(\\mu,\\lambda,N,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists e,m_0,l_0,m,l\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}_S(e,N,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(m_0,\\ell_m,T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(l_0,\\ell_l,T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\\\\\n&amp;\\land m=(e\\upharpoonright T_0)_{*,1}^{(T_0,\\tau_{T_0}),(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})}(m_0)\n\\land l=(e\\upharpoonright T_0)_{*,1}^{(T_0,\\tau_{T_0}),(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})}(l_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mu=m\\land\\lambda\\in H_1(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\operatorname{id}_{\\partial_3N})_{*,1}^{(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N}),(N,\\tau_N)}(\\lambda)\n=(\\operatorname{id}_{\\partial_3N})_{*,1}^{(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N}),(N,\\tau_N)}(l)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\operatorname{id}_{\\partial_3N})_{*,1}^{(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N}),(W_N,\\tau_{W_N})}(\\lambda)\n=0_{W_N,\\tau_{W_N},1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in H_1(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})\\;\\exists!v\\in\\mathbb Z^2\\;\n\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(\\gamma,v(0),\\mu,v(1),\\lambda,\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N},1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}_S(\\mu,\\lambda,N,K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists e,m_0,l_0,m,l\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OrientedSolidTorusEmbedding}_S(e,N,K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(m_0,\\ell_m,T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\n\\land\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(l_0,\\ell_l,T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\\\\\n&amp;\\land m=(e\\upharpoonright T_0)_{*,1}^{(T_0,\\tau_{T_0}),(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})}(m_0)\n\\land l=(e\\upharpoonright T_0)_{*,1}^{(T_0,\\tau_{T_0}),(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})}(l_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mu=m\\land\\lambda\\in H_1(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\operatorname{id}_{\\partial_3N})_{*,1}^{(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N}),(N,\\tau_N)}(\\lambda)\n=(\\operatorname{id}_{\\partial_3N})_{*,1}^{(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N}),(N,\\tau_N)}(l)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\operatorname{id}_{\\partial_3N})_{*,1}^{(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N}),(W_N,\\tau_{W_N})}(\\lambda)\n=0_{W_N,\\tau_{W_N},1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in H_1(\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N})\\;\\exists!v\\in\\mathbb Z^2\\;\n\\mathrm{HomologyLinearCombination}_S(\\gamma,v(0),\\mu,v(1),\\lambda,\\partial_3N,\\tau_{\\partial_3N},1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}_S(\\mu,\\lambda,T,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\subseteq S^3\\;\n(T=\\partial_3N\\land\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}_S(\\mu,\\lambda,N,K)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PeripheralBasis}_S(\\mu,\\lambda,T,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\subseteq S^3\\;\n(T=\\partial_3N\\land\\mathrm{PeripheralBasisForNeighborhood}_S(\\mu,\\lambda,N,K)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MeridianImage}_S(\\phi,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ran}\\phi\\subseteq S^3\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi,T_0,\\tau_{T_0},\\operatorname{ran}\\phi,\\tau_{\\operatorname{ran}\\phi})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m_0\\in H_1(T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(m_0,\\ell_m,T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\n\\land a=\\phi_{*,1}^{(T_0,\\tau_{T_0}),(\\operatorname{ran}\\phi,\\tau_{\\operatorname{ran}\\phi})}(m_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MeridianImage}_S(\\phi,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ran}\\phi\\subseteq S^3\n\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi,T_0,\\tau_{T_0},\\operatorname{ran}\\phi,\\tau_{\\operatorname{ran}\\phi})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m_0\\in H_1(T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SingularLoopClass}_S(m_0,\\ell_m,T_0,\\tau_{T_0})\n\\land a=\\phi_{*,1}^{(T_0,\\tau_{T_0}),(\\operatorname{ran}\\phi,\\tau_{\\operatorname{ran}\\phi})}(m_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>定向采用局部三维拓扑度，而不要求结或管状邻域可微；因此没有把原先的拓扑结定义改为光滑结定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 同时满足在实心环面中的芯方向条件及在结外部中的零同调条件，排除了任意框架所产生的不同经线。管状邻域的芯方向反向时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\lambda\">\\(\\mu,\\lambda\\)</span> 同时反向。</li>\n<li>对野结，本文件不凭名称假定存在管状邻域；该存在性保留在谓词内。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb6796e83e0c5ef4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on"